doc https://arxiv.org/abs/2508.13467
  title The CCOR Compact Coronagraphs for the Geostationary Operational Environmental Satellite-19 (GOES-19) and the Space Weather Follow On (SWFO) Missions
  source Thernisien A.F., Chua D.H., Carter M.T. et al. (U.S. Naval Research Laboratory, NOAA NESDIS/SWO); arXiv:2508.13467v2, eingereicht 19.08.2025
