  claim detektor 2048 x 1920 APS, wie WISPR und SoloHI "They use the same 2048 x 1920 pixels Active Pixel Sensor (APS) as the Wide-Field Imager for Parker Solar Probe (WISPR) and Solar Orbiter Heliospheric Imager (SoloHI)."
  claim datenstufen Ausgabe als FITS-Datei "When received on the ground, the image packets are decompressed and reassembled into a FITS file."
  claim sonnenradius 1 R_sun = 0.266 Grad bei 1 AU "The Rsun values are given for a distance of 1 Astronomical Unit (AU): 1R_{\odot}=0.266\degree."
  claim start GOES-U am 25. Juni 2024 gestartet "GOES-U was launched from Kennedy Space Flight Center (KSFC), Florida, on 25 June 2024."
